      "headline": "Chart climb",
      "supportingCopy": "The song appears on the album \"Malice N Wonderland\" (2009). \"I Wanna Rock\" is the third official single from American rapper, Snoop Dogg's tenth studio album, Malice n Wonderland. Malice n Wonderland is the tenth studio album by American rapper Snoop Dogg; it was released on December 8, 2009, by Doggystyle Records, Capitol Records and Priority Records. Production for the album took place from January 2009 to September 2009 at several recording studios and the production was handled by Battlecat, The-Dream, Tricky Stewart, The Neptunes, Teddy Riley, Lil Jon and Terrace Martin. The album debuted at number 23 on the US Billboard 200 chart, selling 61,000 copies in its first week. Artist: Snoop Dogg · Title: I Wanna Rock · Album: HV 2-10 · Year: 2010 · Genre: Urban · Path: MEDIA/VIDEO/2010's/Snoop Dogg - I Wanna",
